  "repo_truth": "Review 8 returned CHANGES_REQUIRED because all-ones Windows FILE_ID_128 is an unusable sentinel but currently schema-admissible; CreateFileW cannot perform the retained-parent-relative opens required by the protocol; and the current no-classification wording cannot replay the frozen TargetOnly-to-RealPathAdopted future diff. Official Microsoft authority documents that NtCreateFile is the user-mode ZwCreateFile equivalent, OBJECT_ATTRIBUTES.RootDirectory binds a relative name to a retained directory handle, FILE_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT bypasses normal reparse processing, and both zero and all-ones FILE_ID_128 values must be ignored. The complete 79-path subject is frozen at sha256:9505af0c11c3874115955287b69c4a9395fb2c646f90636e9b749d1794c0289d. Production, selectors, staging, and commit remain frozen.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Edit only 03-seam-crosswalk.md, 06-proof-and-regression-ledger.md, and the seven existing HCM-2.3 atomic-authority surfaces: SPEC, runtime contract, control schema, control vectors, plan, todo, and the atomic authority proof.",
    "Reject both 0x00000000000000000000000000000000 and 0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff FILE_ID_128 sentinels structurally and semantically everywhere; add exact executed negatives for retained source, enumerated/opened child comparison, destination observation, and same-live-object continuity; repin every affected fingerprint, vector, aggregate, mutation count, and checker assertion.",
    "Replace path-based retained-parent child observation opens with private user-mode ntdll!NtCreateFile FFI using OBJECT_ATTRIBUTES.RootDirectory equal to the retained parent handle and a validated single child UNICODE_STRING.",
    "Freeze exact NtCreateFile rules: FILE_OPEN disposition; OBJ_CASE_INSENSITIVE plus OBJ_DONT_REPARSE; FILE_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT; directory versus non-directory CreateOptions; synchronous access where required; no FILE_SHARE_DELETE on retained ancestor/source/parent handles; exact read/attribute/control/delete access by handle role; reject every non-NT_SUCCESS or unexpected IoStatusBlock result before authority.",
    "Use NtCreateFile for every Windows component open and every post-rename destination rebound observation. FILE_RENAME_INFO.RootDirectory remains the retained-parent rename anchor. CreateFileW may remain only for the initial already-authorized root/volume acquisition where no retained parent exists and may not prove a child open.",
    "Specify a new private local FFI/helper inside artifact_lineage_store.rs for future implementation, with no Cargo dependency, public API, signature, static/global state, or new existing HIGH/CRITICAL symbol. Treat that future helper as CRITICAL and leave it unauthorized with the existing sixteen stopped surfaces.",
    "Restore the current exact registry-brief subset baseline to TargetOnly in both crosswalk rows, the proof-ledger classification paragraph, and todo status while preserving known-non-authoritative production, zero landed evidence, no PG-KIND-02 closure, and the frozen future TargetOnly-to-RealPathAdopted diff.",
    "Preserve every prior atomic invariant, status gate, sixteen-symbol stop, production byte, and HCM-2.2 behavior."
